[
  {
    "start": 0.35,
    "end": 1.95,
    "text": "That famous picture of an ape"
  },
  {
    "start": 1.95,
    "end": 3.6625,
    "text": "slowly turning into a modern"
  },
  {
    "start": 3.6625,
    "end": 5.45,
    "text": "person leaves out the most"
  },
  {
    "start": 5.45,
    "end": 7.825,
    "text": "important part: the branches."
  },
  {
    "start": 8.424999999999999,
    "end": 10.337499999999999,
    "text": "Human evolution was not a straight"
  },
  {
    "start": 10.337499999999999,
    "end": 12.399999999999999,
    "text": "sequence of improved models."
  },
  {
    "start": 12.399999999999999,
    "end": 14.924999999999999,
    "text": "Populations separated, adapted"
  },
  {
    "start": 14.924999999999999,
    "end": 16.35,
    "text": "to different environments,"
  },
  {
    "start": 16.35,
    "end": 17.95,
    "text": "and sometimes overlapped in"
  },
  {
    "start": 17.95,
    "end": 18.85,
    "text": "time."
  },
  {
    "start": 19.3,
    "end": 21.0875,
    "text": "Some branches disappeared."
  },
  {
    "start": 21.0875,
    "end": 22.7375,
    "text": "Others met again and exchanged"
  },
  {
    "start": 22.7375,
    "end": 23.725,
    "text": "genes."
  },
  {
    "start": 24.15,
    "end": 25.575,
    "text": "And humans did not descend"
  },
  {
    "start": 25.575,
    "end": 26.974999999999998,
    "text": "from the chimpanzees living"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.974999999999998,
    "end": 29.4625,
    "text": "today. Our lineages share older"
  },
  {
    "start": 29.4625,
    "end": 31.525,
    "text": "ancestors, then followed different"
  },
  {
    "start": 31.525,
    "end": 32.525,
    "text": "paths."
  },
  {
    "start": 32.975,
    "end": 35.175,
    "text": "Even a simple tree has limits,"
  },
  {
    "start": 35.175,
    "end": 36.625,
    "text": "because interbreeding can"
  },
  {
    "start": 36.625,
    "end": 38.4625,
    "text": "reconnect branches that a tidy"
  },
  {
    "start": 38.4625,
    "end": 40.3,
    "text": "diagram keeps apart."
  },
  {
    "start": 40.75,
    "end": 42.675,
    "text": "So picture a branching history"
  },
  {
    "start": 42.675,
    "end": 44.1875,
    "text": "with a few connections across"
  },
  {
    "start": 44.1875,
    "end": 46.2875,
    "text": "it. Not a ladder with us standing"
  },
  {
    "start": 46.2875,
    "end": 47.625,
    "text": "on the top rung."
  },
  {
    "start": 48.075,
    "end": 49.612500000000004,
    "text": "Being the surviving branch"
  },
  {
    "start": 49.612500000000004,
    "end": 51.9,
    "text": "tells us which lineage remains."
  },
  {
    "start": 51.9,
    "end": 53.625,
    "text": "It does not prove that every"
  },
  {
    "start": 53.625,
    "end": 55.550000000000004,
    "text": "other branch was a failed attempt"
  },
  {
    "start": 55.550000000000004,
    "end": 56.7,
    "text": "to become us."
  }
]